325
22:33.150 --> 22:34.320
hurry up and take care of it, Third.

326
22:34.750 --> 22:35.870
It's for your own sake.

327
22:36.030 --> 22:37.550
Also, lock the door.

328
22:37.570 --> 22:39.300
Look out for your own safety.

329
22:40.110 --> 22:42.110
You're not in the same position anymore.

330
22:42.120 --> 22:43.970
No one can take care of you or protect you.

331
22:45.500 --> 22:46.270
Alright.

332
22:47.300 --> 22:48.700
I'm heading out. See you.

333
22:48.990 --> 22:50.100
Sunny, wait...

334
22:51.220 --> 22:51.960
Hm?

335
23:00.520 --> 23:01.790
I'm sorry,

336
23:02.760 --> 23:04.500
and thank you for everything.

337
23:31.410 --> 23:32.410
I...

338
23:33.000 --> 23:34.320
love you, Third.

339
23:35.890 --> 23:37.190
Don't think that I don't.

340
23:41.300 --> 23:42.490
I'm sorry...

341
23:43.350 --> 23:44.770
I couldn't take good care of you guys.

342
23:45.130 --> 23:46.390
That's why it ended up like this.

343
23:49.790 --> 23:52.150
But whatever happens, you...

344
23:52.160 --> 23:53.500
You can always call me.

345
23:54.410 --> 23:55.890
I'll be on standby.

346
23:59.680 --> 24:00.790
Alright, Mama.

347
24:05.290 --> 24:06.290
Mm.

348
24:07.300 --> 24:08.380
I'm leaving now. See you.

349
24:21.640 --> 24:26.810
[Baan Tiew Shop]

350
24:28.400 --> 24:29.890
Hello, what's up?

351
24:30.190 --> 24:31.380
Hello, View.

352
24:31.600 --> 24:32.950
Where are you? What are you doing?

353
24:33.100 --> 24:34.790
I'm about to eat.

354
24:35.890 --> 24:37.080
Eat where?

355
24:37.690 --> 24:38.690
At our place.

356
24:38.900 --> 24:40.200
Is Jay there with you?

357
24:40.360 --> 24:42.280
Stay away from the doors and the windows,

358
24:42.480 --> 24:44.390
take your food, and eat it in your room.

359
24:44.410 --> 24:45.860
Ugh, damn you, Wan!

360
24:45.870 --> 24:47.940
You're acting like someone's gonna launch a bazooka at me.

361
24:48.550 --> 24:49.240
And look,

362
24:49.590 --> 24:51.910
I've been with that guy from morning till night.

363
24:51.920 --> 24:53.010
We might as well get together.

364
24:54.400 --> 24:55.990
Hey, you can't do that!

365
24:56.010 --> 24:57.260
Well, duh!

366
24:57.610 --> 24:58.950
Stop being paranoid.

367
24:58.970 --> 25:00.360
No one's gonna do anything to me.

368
25:00.380 --> 25:02.290
I can take care of myself, okay?

369
25:02.880 --> 25:04.060
Whoa... Shit, shit.

370
25:04.070 --> 25:04.550
What now?

371
25:04.560 --> 25:05.690
I'm hanging up.

372
25:08.110 --> 25:09.400
Dad, Mom,

373
25:09.600 --> 25:11.380
don't tell him I'm here.

374
25:17.990 --> 25:18.900
Hello.

375
25:20.850 --> 25:21.560
Uh...

376
25:21.880 --> 25:23.350
I'm here to see Wan.

377
25:23.360 --> 25:24.990
Is... Is he here?

378
25:25.780 --> 25:26.600
No.

379
25:29.490 --> 25:31.190
I haven't been able to get a hold of Wan.

380
25:31.430 --> 25:33.190
I went to his condo, and View said he wasn't there.

381
25:34.250 --> 25:35.920
You guys haven't talked to him at all?

382
25:36.640 --> 25:37.680
We have not.

383
25:42.200 --> 25:43.890
Then I'm sorry for bothering you,

384
25:47.620 --> 25:50.190
but if you get to talk to him,

385
25:52.110 --> 25:53.490
please tell him

386
25:53.890 --> 25:55.430
that I miss him.

387
26:05.400 --> 26:06.400
I'm leaving now.

388
26:42.000 --> 26:43.240
Wanna go to a cafe?

389
26:43.400 --> 26:45.800
I heard they have cute elephants and a painting activity, too.

390
26:45.890 --> 26:47.420
Please, please, please, please, please, please?

391
26:48.650 --> 26:49.690
If you're with me,

392
26:51.120 --> 26:52.690
I'll go anywhere.

393
29:12.120 --> 29:12.740
Mr. Third,

394
29:12.760 --> 29:13.980
Mr. Nine's going up to your room.

395
29:14.000 --> 29:15.270
I couldn't stop him.

396
29:41.650 --> 29:42.600
How did you get up here?

397
29:43.090 --> 29:45.060
Everyone in this country knows we're an on-screen couple,

398
29:45.890 --> 29:47.130
so they let me up here.

399
29:52.720 --> 29:54.530
[Delete from this iPhone]

400
30:05.790 --> 30:08.290
[Hidden]

401
30:13.970 --> 30:14.860
[Unhide]

402
30:30.230 --> 30:31.330
Third.

403
30:57.520 --> 30:58.910
I'm about to post the video

404
30:59.810 --> 31:01.500
- where Nine let himself fall... - Don't do it.

405
31:09.610 --> 31:10.790
I already gave up.

406
31:15.490 --> 31:16.900
Don't do anything at all.

407
31:18.510 --> 31:21.100
Just return to the place you belong.

408
31:24.420 --> 31:25.300
Wan,

409
31:26.320 --> 31:27.410
I'm begging you.

410
31:32.010 --> 31:33.400
I need you.

411
31:37.000 --> 31:38.600
Please don't ever leave me again.

412
31:41.210 --> 31:42.090
I'm posting this video

413
31:42.100 --> 31:43.720
and telling everyone you're not at fault.

414
31:46.910 --> 31:48.410
What's the point, Third?

415
31:49.720 --> 31:51.680
To put Nine on blast so people can drag him?

416
31:52.820 --> 31:53.820
Yes.

417
31:55.230 --> 31:56.680
I don't care about any of them.

418
31:59.300 --> 32:02.000
But we don't know if he did it, right?

419
32:04.590 --> 32:06.600
Wasn't this the reason

420
32:06.610 --> 32:08.120
you didn't leak the video from the start?

421
32:16.090 --> 32:18.100
Let's stop it right here.

422
32:18.550 --> 32:19.540
Everything.

423
32:21.520 --> 32:23.090
I don't wanna hurt anyone anymore.

424
32:23.200 --> 32:24.110
I won't stop.

425
32:26.310 --> 32:28.130
I will find the person who did it.

426
32:28.800 --> 32:29.900
But right now...

427
32:30.890 --> 32:33.310
I don't agree with you leaking this video.

428
32:35.520 --> 32:37.690
Don't drag me into this again.

429
32:50.010 --> 32:50.790
Let go.

430
32:52.410 --> 32:53.700
Just move on from me.

431
32:54.910 --> 32:56.000
Can you move on from me?

432
32:58.080 --> 32:59.100
I can't.

433
33:01.510 --> 33:03.200
I swear

434
33:05.510 --> 33:07.890
I won't ever keep anything from you again.

435
33:09.410 --> 33:10.960
No matter what happens,

436
33:10.970 --> 33:12.300
no matter what comes my way,

437
33:13.130 --> 33:14.990
I'll ask for your opinion first.

438
33:22.610 --> 33:24.320
I love you so, so much, Wan.

439
33:25.020 --> 33:26.290
I really do.

440
33:27.810 --> 33:30.210
A life without you has no damn meaning.

441
33:33.100 --> 33:34.490
I just realized that...

442
33:36.340 --> 33:38.310
I couldn't live without you.

443
33:42.000 --> 33:43.500
So from now on,

444
33:43.520 --> 33:45.100
I'll do whatever it takes.

445
33:46.660 --> 33:49.530
No matter what it costs me, or no matter how hard it gets,

446
33:51.090 --> 33:53.010
I'll do everything for us to get back together.

447
33:55.150 --> 33:56.410
No matter how hard you try,

448
33:56.420 --> 33:57.790
- I won't... - No matter how firm you are,

449
33:57.800 --> 33:59.320
I'll win you back,

450
34:00.570 --> 34:02.610
and I'll make it so that you wanna take me back.

451
34:04.420 --> 34:10.199
♫I'm only asking that I never lose your touch♫

452
34:10.230 --> 34:12.810
♫I'm sorry I messed up♫

453
34:13.150 --> 34:14.699
I'm not giving up, Wan.

454
34:16.110 --> 34:19.960
♫That's all I want♫

455
34:38.239 --> 34:39.760
The fashion week in Milan,

456
34:40.500 --> 34:41.960
the brand's already confirmed it, Nine.

457
34:42.760 --> 34:43.530
Alright.

458
34:44.040 --> 34:46.060
And that big project I mentioned,

459
34:46.650 --> 34:48.830
the series called 'IDYLLIC LIES,'

460
34:50.139 --> 34:53.690
it's been confirmed that you'll take a lead role in its third season!

461
34:54.969 --> 34:56.100
Are you serious, Pitch?!

462
34:56.239 --> 34:57.150
Of course.

463
34:57.930 --> 34:59.690
And I have to fly to the United States, right?

464
34:59.700 --> 35:00.460
Yes!

465
35:00.730 --> 35:01.730
Of course!

466
35:01.750 --> 35:04.540
You're going international!

467
35:04.560 --> 35:05.800
Holy shit!

468
35:17.160 --> 35:17.960
Pitch,

469
35:21.850 --> 35:23.340
Nine has to move out.

470
35:24.140 --> 35:25.020
Why?

471
35:25.320 --> 35:26.070
What happened?

472
35:57.430 --> 35:58.540
Is everything alright?

473
35:59.050 --> 36:00.400
I saw it under the door.

474
36:01.150 --> 36:02.430
Is this yours, Nine?

475
36:14.540 --> 36:15.540
Nine,

476
36:16.150 --> 36:17.470
how did they know about Juno?

477
36:21.950 --> 36:23.190
[Everywhere you go, I'll always be there for the good and the bad,

478
36:23.200 --> 36:24.270
whether it's about Wan, Third, Juno,

479
36:24.280 --> 36:25.560
or Thee who already died, XOXO]

480
36:49.490 --> 36:50.710
Wow...

481
36:50.980 --> 36:52.410
There are flowers.

482
36:54.690 --> 36:55.760
Real ones, by the way.

483
36:59.500 --> 37:00.520
You like them?

484
37:05.380 --> 37:06.290
Oh?

485
37:08.100 --> 37:09.230
- Hello. - Hello.

486
37:09.250 --> 37:10.380
- Hi there. - Hello, hello.

487
37:18.150 --> 37:19.140
Uh...

488
37:19.880 --> 37:22.000
"Congratulations to Mr. Ren,

489
37:22.460 --> 37:25.600
the new executive of 'NPY'"

490
37:27.300 --> 37:28.000
Huh?

491
37:28.320 --> 37:30.260
Thank you, boyfriend of the executive.

492
37:32.170 --> 37:33.370
- Huh? - Huh?

493
37:36.930 --> 37:37.480
Baffled.

494
37:37.860 --> 37:39.060
I'm baffled.

495
37:39.070 --> 37:41.540
Uh, so that means

496
37:41.550 --> 37:43.870
when the investor pulled out,

497
37:44.610 --> 37:45.760
you took pretty major damage, right?

498
37:46.350 --> 37:47.600
Well, pretty much.

499
37:47.810 --> 37:49.530
North already took care of it.

500
37:51.970 --> 37:52.780
"I"

501
37:52.800 --> 37:53.580
already...

502
37:53.590 --> 37:54.880
took care of it.

503
37:59.970 --> 38:02.550
Then I'll give you some time to talk to Renji.

504
38:03.860 --> 38:04.570
- Oh, right. - Okay.

505
38:05.290 --> 38:05.870
Alright.

506
38:15.600 --> 38:16.930
Oh, please take a seat.

507
38:16.940 --> 38:18.540
- Okay, we’re taking a seat. Sure. - Okay.

508
38:18.560 --> 38:19.560
Hang on a sec.

509
38:20.800 --> 38:21.990
Uh...

510
38:24.720 --> 38:26.870
Alright, let me ask this straight up.

511
38:27.170 --> 38:28.120
So, right now,

512
38:28.570 --> 38:29.850
you've completely replaced North, right?

513
38:31.250 --> 38:33.490
So now, Ren is the big boss?

514
38:33.670 --> 38:34.970
The big boss.

515
38:35.280 --> 38:36.190
I like that.

516
38:39.300 --> 38:40.980
So, the reason I asked you to come

517
38:41.000 --> 38:44.060
is that I'm planning on a new series,

518
38:44.460 --> 38:46.300
so I need you as the director

519
38:46.310 --> 38:47.240
and you as the acting coach.

520
38:49.350 --> 38:50.940
A new series?

521
38:51.660 --> 38:52.520
What about 'The Deep Between Us'?

522
38:52.650 --> 38:53.550
Screw it.

523
38:54.300 --> 38:55.690
We have to move forward.

524
38:57.050 --> 38:58.600
Without any strings pulled this time.

525
38:59.310 --> 39:01.040
Let's go for full-fledged skills.

526
39:02.780 --> 39:03.750
You mean, without any strings pulled

527
39:03.760 --> 39:05.330
like that for "Renji." None of that?

528
39:08.670 --> 39:10.680
Exactly. I was just testing the system.

529
39:11.370 --> 39:13.160
But I know now the system can't change.

530
39:13.180 --> 39:14.160
If you want change,

531
39:14.170 --> 39:15.650
you need to own the system.

532
39:15.960 --> 39:17.160
So you're saying that

533
39:17.190 --> 39:18.570
as a director,

534
39:18.660 --> 39:21.660
I have all the decision-making authority?

535
39:21.970 --> 39:23.020
You're right.

536
39:26.280 --> 39:27.390
You mean it?

537
39:28.160 --> 39:29.530
I mean it.

538
39:30.850 --> 39:31.850
Okay.

539
39:32.040 --> 39:35.040
So, are you still gonna cast the same male leads?

540
39:35.280 --> 39:36.260
Not sure...

541
39:36.270 --> 39:37.580
but definitely not Nine.

542
39:41.180 --> 39:41.960
Um...

543
39:42.680 --> 39:43.680
I'm not sure...

544
39:44.110 --> 39:46.060
if you have heard, but Nine

545
39:46.370 --> 39:48.590
has been cast in 'IDYLLIC LIES.'

546
39:48.870 --> 39:49.560
Huh?

547
39:50.060 --> 39:51.520
'IDYLLIC LIES'?

548
39:51.860 --> 39:52.860
Yes.

549
39:54.160 --> 39:55.450
So...

550
39:55.660 --> 39:58.100
how about we all try to get along?

551
39:58.120 --> 39:59.250
- Mm. - Yeah?

552
39:59.260 --> 40:01.860
We might just work together again in the future.

553
40:02.340 --> 40:03.780
And honestly,

554
40:03.800 --> 40:06.250
it will benefit your company, Ren.

555
40:13.320 --> 40:14.340
Nine,

556
40:14.770 --> 40:16.520
I heard you talked to the content team

557
40:16.540 --> 40:18.670
about releasing the yearly plan yourself?

558
40:19.390 --> 40:20.300
Yes.

559
40:21.260 --> 40:23.500
I want us to tell the media first

560
40:23.860 --> 40:25.790
that there's a series coming up as a mega project.

561
40:25.820 --> 40:26.890
That's not how it works, though!

562
40:27.060 --> 40:28.220
What's the damn rush?!

563
40:28.650 --> 40:30.760
Well, I wanna announce it within two to three days!

564
40:30.950 --> 40:33.120
That way, it's not far off from the fashion week buzz.

565
40:33.210 --> 40:34.930
We're the same fucking team!

566
40:34.950 --> 40:36.260
If you don't trust me,

567
40:36.280 --> 40:37.440
how are we gonna keep working?!

568
40:37.460 --> 40:38.770
But I want...

569
40:39.180 --> 40:40.270
Pitch,

570
40:40.450 --> 40:41.790
I'm sorry on his behalf.

571
40:48.370 --> 40:49.760
It's been really rough lately.

572
40:57.870 --> 40:58.950
Okay, here's the deal.

573
41:01.370 --> 41:02.930
I'll try releasing the news.

574
41:03.460 --> 41:05.970
Nevertheless, we can't do it officially before they do.

575
41:07.710 --> 41:09.160
You understand, right?

576
41:13.270 --> 41:14.090
He does.

577
41:38.870 --> 41:40.250
Don't do anything right now.

578
41:42.120 --> 41:44.010
Renji said he had a new card up his sleeves

579
41:44.170 --> 41:45.490
that could take care of Nine.

580
41:45.600 --> 41:46.880
You don't have to follow them like this.

581
41:46.900 --> 41:47.830
Who are you?

582
41:50.370 --> 41:51.370
My name is Pla.

583
41:51.890 --> 41:53.390
I'm helping Wan.

584
41:54.920 --> 41:55.960
Helping Wan?

585
41:58.030 --> 41:59.450
Wan helped me before,

586
42:03.680 --> 42:04.770
and now,

587
42:05.170 --> 42:06.560
I have to help him.

588
42:08.180 --> 42:09.580
But if you don't believe that...

589
42:09.600 --> 42:11.060
I'm helping him,

590
42:11.080 --> 42:12.370
wanna go see Renji together?

591
42:14.780 --> 42:15.720
Where?

592
42:16.800 --> 42:18.210
NPY.

593
42:30.870 --> 42:32.330
Why the fuck are you getting involved?

594
42:34.800 --> 42:35.800
Simply put,

595
42:36.160 --> 42:37.290
for fun.

596
42:38.760 --> 42:39.670
Ren...

597
42:42.360 --> 42:44.380
He attacked my partner,

598
42:45.060 --> 42:46.240
caused 'The Deep Between Us' to fall through

599
42:46.660 --> 42:48.250
and the investor to pull out.

600
42:48.860 --> 42:50.040
Most importantly,

601
42:50.270 --> 42:51.960
he destroyed my company's reputation.

602
42:52.960 --> 42:54.140
Now, can I get involved?

603
43:02.830 --> 43:04.270
Long time no see, Third.

604
43:08.680 --> 43:09.680
Juno...

605
43:12.170 --> 43:13.660
Thank you for coming.

606
43:14.570 --> 43:15.570
Mm.

607
43:18.470 --> 43:19.760
It's not easy

608
43:19.780 --> 43:20.970
to take down Nine.

609
43:25.960 --> 43:27.510
Should we talk about it first?

610
43:41.660 --> 43:42.930
Juno plans to hold a press conference,

611
43:42.940 --> 43:44.410
telling everyone the truth

612
43:44.960 --> 43:46.590
about everything Nine did.

613
43:47.290 --> 43:48.740
But I feel like

614
43:48.760 --> 43:50.700
it's not enough weight

615
43:50.860 --> 43:53.270
since what happened to Juno was already so long ago.

616
43:53.290 --> 43:55.250
Plus, there's no evidence.

617
43:55.940 --> 43:57.830
Not with Wan, though,

618
43:58.350 --> 43:59.300
because right now,

619
43:59.320 --> 44:02.470
we know who Co, the person who leaked the video is.

620
44:02.910 --> 44:04.510
Third saw the guy earlier.

621
44:04.760 --> 44:06.860
If we can get him on our side as the witness,

622
44:06.880 --> 44:07.750
then we're settled.

623
44:08.070 --> 44:10.170
We can't let this kind of person go.

624
44:10.900 --> 44:11.960
He's gotta go through

625
44:12.250 --> 44:14.080
what he put people through.

626
44:20.110 --> 44:22.800
I guess Third also has a story to tell?

627
44:24.840 --> 44:25.790
I...

628
44:25.960 --> 44:29.150
take it that you and Nine were friends back in school,

629
44:30.570 --> 44:31.360
right?

630
44:34.660 --> 44:35.360
Yes.

631
44:42.460 --> 44:43.590
So, you're in?

632
44:44.860 --> 44:45.960
I'm in.

633
44:46.870 --> 44:48.490
I'll hold a press conference for you.

634
44:50.860 --> 44:52.250
As for that pool jumping video,

635
44:52.260 --> 44:53.270
I'll be the one who leaks it.

636
44:55.110 --> 44:56.860
The company can screw itself.

637
44:57.560 --> 44:59.040
If North wants it back, he can have it.

638
44:59.170 --> 45:00.170
Hold on a sec.

639
45:00.460 --> 45:01.570
Ren, what the hell are you talking about?

640
45:02.400 --> 45:04.150
I made a deal with North

641
45:04.660 --> 45:05.710
that if I leaked the video,

642
45:05.970 --> 45:07.840
he'd claim back all the company's shares.

643
45:08.250 --> 45:10.150
So? Who cares?

644
45:17.760 --> 45:18.480
I'm ready,

645
45:25.460 --> 45:26.950
but Wan has to be in, too.

646
45:28.150 --> 45:29.760
If Wan doesn't agree, I'm not doing it.

647
45:39.760 --> 45:42.170
Everyone, today, we're with a hottie

648
45:42.190 --> 45:44.310
who's absolutely all the rage right now!

649
45:44.330 --> 45:47.190
Welcome, Nine Nopphanat.

650
45:47.210 --> 45:48.310
- Right. - Hello.

651
45:48.310 --> 45:49.640
Yes, hello.

652
45:49.650 --> 45:51.050
- This is it... - Right.

653
45:51.070 --> 45:53.080
The perfume I use in my daily life.

654
45:53.100 --> 45:54.800
It smells good, and...

655
45:54.810 --> 45:56.080
